  "slug": "low-carb-jicama-tostadas",
  "name": "Low-Carb Jicama Tostadas",
  "recipe_type": "main",
  "brief_description": "Crunchy grain-free tostadas made of jicama. Top them with chicken tinga, ceviche, shrimp, or veggies. Low in calories and keto friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Wash jicama thoroughly with cool water and remove all dirt using a vegetable brush. Trim both ends of the jicama and peel with a vegetable peeler, removing all skin and tough flesh."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Slice jicama with the 1/10-inch blade of a mandoline."
    }
  ],
